### ==========================================
### ADMIN TAGS
### ==========================================

### List

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/tags
Accept: application/json


### Create

POST http://localhost:8000/api/admin/tags
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Artificial Intelligence 2",
    "slug": "artificial-intelligence-2"
}



### Assign Tags To Post

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1/tags
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tag_ids": [
        1,
        2
    ]
}


### ==========================================
### PUBLIC TAGS
### ==========================================

### List tags

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/tags
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### TAG DETAILS
### ==========================================

### Replace ai with your actual slug

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/tags/artificial-intelligence
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================
### TAG DETAILS
### ==========================================

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/tags/ai
Accept: application/json